  "JwtSettings": { "SecretKey": "..." },
  "AzureStorageSettings": { "ConnectionString": "..." },
  "TwilioSettings": {
    "AccountSid": "...",
    "AuthToken": "...",
    "PhoneNumber": "..."
  }
}
```

## Testing

- Frontend: Vitest configured (see `vitest.config.ts`)
- No E2E framework yet, consider Cypress/Playwright
- Mock API responses in tests with MSW or fetch mocking

## Performance Optimizations Already Applied

- ✅ Virtual scrolling for chat history (TanStack Virtual)
- ✅ Infinite queries with pagination
- ✅ Memoized reversed messages array
- ✅ Custom scrollbar styling to avoid layout thrashing
- ⚠️ Consider: Image lazy loading for avatars
- ⚠️ Consider: Message read receipts debouncing

## Useful Commands

```bash
# Frontend
npm run dev           # Start dev server (port 5173)
npm run build         # Production build
npm run format        # Format with Biome
npm run lint          # Lint with Biome

# Backend
dotnet run            # Run development server (port 5000)
dotnet build          # Build solution
dotnet ef migrations add {name}  # Create migration
dotnet ef database update        # Apply migrations
docker compose up -d  # Start PostgreSQL
```

